&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital Marketing Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are open to candidates located in or near any of our U.S. office locations: Emeryville, CA; Durham, NC; Addison, TX; Bellevue, WA; or Reston, VA&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary/Objectives&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tanium is seeking a strategic, data-driven Paid Search Manager to own and scale our paid search and video performance. This role will play a critical part in contributing to pipeline growth, owning global paid search and video programs across Google &amp;amp; Microsoft on the Digital team. You&#39;ll define strategy, manage budgets, optimize performance, build testing roadmaps, and deliver insights that shape our broader digital advertising approach. We&#39;re looking for someone who has strong analytical skills combined with creative instincts to drive brand awareness, boost conversions, and unlock revenue opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Job Functions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead end-to-end strategy and execution of global paid search and video campaigns across Google &amp;amp; Microsoft, including platform-specific optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own quarterly and monthly budget planning and daily pacing across paid search/video&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create dashboards and a reporting cadence that enables transparent communication of campaign performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure rigorous and reliable measurement by implementing consistent naming conventions, tracking parameter management, and conversion event tracking setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Web team on landing page strategy and A/B testing initiatives to improve on-page conversion rates or paid traffic and drive continuous optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Integrated Campaigns team to drive creative and content that will perform; ensure creative is refreshed at the right cadence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with organic search counterpart to align paid and organic strategies, share keyword insights, and optimize holistic search performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get insights from product and content marketing on messaging, keyword, and competitive insights to drive stronger ad relevance, engagement, and conversion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum &amp;amp; Preferred Job Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ Years of B2B Digital Marketing experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of Google &amp;amp; Microsoft Platform experience managing Paid Search, YouTube &amp;amp; Demand Generation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong bias toward action and measurable outcomes; result driven&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical and process-driven approach to campaign optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail and a transparent written and verbal communication style&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Marketo, Salesforce, and GA4 — comfortable working across the ad platform to CRM data flow to&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;troubleshoot tracking gaps and validate conversion accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;com Tanium Inc. All Rights Reserved&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stays current on platform algorithm changes and emerging ad technologies (e.g., AI-driven bidding, agentic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;campaign tools) to keep channel strategy ahead of the curve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Other&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Google Ads and Microsoft Advertising, including Search, YouTube, and Performance Max campaign types&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with A/B testing methodologies and conversion rate optimization practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of marketing automation and analytics tools such as Marketo, Salesforce, and GA4&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical and process-driven approach to campaign optimization with strong attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear and transparent written and verbal communication style suited to cross-functional collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tanium Competencies:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates initiative and motivation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent oral and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team player&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Person of high ethics and integrity&lt;/li&gt;
