&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Basics:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our Product Management team is actively seeking a new &lt;strong&gt;Director of Product Management focused on Data Platform, Cloud, and SaaS Architecture&lt;/strong&gt; to join our passionate, driven, and fast-paced team.&amp;nbsp;In this role, you will own and shape Tanium’s end-to-end data strategy across cloud and SaaS environments, partnering closely with engineering, product, design, and cross-functional leadership to define how Tanium stores, accesses, queries, moves, and visualizes data across the platform.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will bring deep experience in cloud and SaaS architectures, data platforms, and enterprise-scale systems, with the ability to translate complex customer, product, and technical requirements into actionable strategy and execution. You will need to be successful influencing cross-functionally across all levels of the organization, operating horizontally across multiple teams and pods, and drive clarity in ambiguous, complex technical domains. You must also be comfortable setting strategic direction while staying close enough to the work to make high-quality product and architecture decisions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is an individual contributor role.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the product strategy and roadmap for Tanium’s cloud/SaaS data platform, from ideation through launch, in close partnership with engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and drive the short- and long-term roadmap for Tanium’s end-to-end data architecture, including storage, access, query, visualization, and data movement capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product Managers, Engineering, Design, and leadership across the organization to align priorities across multiple pods and ensure teams are building toward a cohesive data strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead product direction for how data is surfaced and experienced in Atlas and the UI, with a focus on improving trust, usability, reliability, and customer value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the strategy for data movement and integration capabilities, including export, import, and scalable data exchange patterns across products and use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear product requirements, technical specifications, use cases, business logic, and success metrics for data platform capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineering leadership to make durable architectural decisions across complex, distributed cloud and SaaS systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion data quality as a core product priority, setting expectations and mechanisms to improve consistency, reliability, and trust throughout the data lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal teams on enablement, training, and launch materials to ensure successful adoption of new data capabilities and platform improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with business, technical, customer-facing, and go-to-market teams to understand customer needs, solve daily challenges, and identify opportunities for product differentiation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage innovation and trends in cloud, SaaS, data architecture, analytics, and enterprise platform technologies to develop strategic solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
