&lt;li&gt;Intuition to identify high-leverage configuration and compliance gaps that align with Tanium&#39;s platform and present opportunities for rapid growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to take on firmly-entrenched, legacy configuration management incumbents with creative approaches to technology and a tenacious pursuit to build and grow a product&#39;s customer base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to establish and nurture strong customer champions who can serve as advocates and an informal advisory board.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written communication, verbal communication, and executive presentation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adept at understanding and navigating complex organizations in order to inspire and influence internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grit; ability to deal with and overcome challenges, and to thrive in ambiguity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
