&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Basics:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At&amp;nbsp;Tanium, our&amp;nbsp;Regional Vice President role fulfills a necessary role of leading a team of&amp;nbsp;Solutions Engineers which serve our customers&amp;nbsp;and prospects&amp;nbsp;by understanding&amp;nbsp;their&amp;nbsp;challenges and&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;the Tanium value proposition&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;solve&amp;nbsp;tough&amp;nbsp;customer&amp;nbsp;problems.&amp;nbsp;This&amp;nbsp;role&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;charged&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;preserving the&amp;nbsp;incredible&amp;nbsp;culture&amp;nbsp;upon&amp;nbsp;which&amp;nbsp;Tanium&amp;nbsp;was&amp;nbsp;built.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Operating&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;collaborative&amp;nbsp;team&amp;nbsp;environment&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;other&amp;nbsp;teams&amp;nbsp;like&amp;nbsp;sales,&amp;nbsp;product&amp;nbsp;management,&amp;nbsp;enterprise&amp;nbsp;services, marketing, and customer support,&amp;nbsp;RVPs contribute to each customer’s success by leading technical sales opportunities for customer prospects and in our most strategic existing accounts. RVPs must have unwavering leadership skills and remain technically relevant with the Tanium portfolio.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;RVPs&amp;nbsp;must&amp;nbsp;be&amp;nbsp;ready&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;any&amp;nbsp;customer&amp;nbsp;facing&amp;nbsp;situation&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;their&amp;nbsp;team&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;are&amp;nbsp;seen&amp;nbsp;as&amp;nbsp;experts&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;account&amp;nbsp;and territory planning, technical&amp;nbsp;expertise, technical sales, and leadership within the assigned territory.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;*This role requires someone to be located in CT time zone and will require 30-50% travel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
