&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Leading&amp;nbsp;technical pre-sales opportunities&amp;nbsp;and deep technical sales conversations and demonstrations&amp;nbsp;as both a technical sales expert and leader within the region&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:4}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
