&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Note: This role is Hybrid in office 3 days per week&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Basics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Tanium is seeking a Senior Product Manager to drive delivery across our AI Core Services portfolio. You will be building the core experience and infrastructure that serve our agentic platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;This is an execution-focused product role. The portfolio is pivoting toward AI and agentic workflows, and we need a PM who ships. You will own the day-to-day product work that turns strategy into delivered software. You will partner directly with engineering and UX teams, own requirements and prioritization for your product areas, and carry capabilities from idea through launch and enablement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;A successful candidate will be an experienced product manager with a strong record of delivery and the cross-functional skill to execute across all levels of the organization. Passion for the product management craft, passion for delivery, and the agility to adjust as the business evolves are the foundation of success in this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Own the delivery of product capabilities from ideation to launch in partnership with engineering and UX teams, including grooming, prioritization, acceptance criteria, and release readiness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Shape the core platform workflows and experiences that teams across the organization rely on at enterprise scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Translate customer needs, field signals, and support escalations into clear, prioritized requirements and specs. We run a spec-driven, AI-assisted development process where PMs author the specs that drive engineering execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Work alongside internal domain experts to ground product decisions in real-world use cases and practice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Conduct discovery with existing customers and present product vision, updates, and progress to internal and external stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Partner with product marketing, enablement, and support to ensure new capabilities land successfully with customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Track and deliver objectives and key results (OKRs) to measure product success and guide iterative improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Adapt plans quickly as priorities shift with the business and the market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;3 to 6 years of product management experience, with shipped products you can walk us through&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Strong cross-functional instincts. You influence without authority across engineering, design, marketing, sales, and support, and you communicate clearly with each audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Bias to action and outcome orientation. You drive results without complete information and stay anchored on what matters most&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;High learning velocity. You ramp quickly in new domains and connect what you learn to what matters for the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Hands-on technical experience with a variety of AI tools and a passion for transforming how product management works through AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Confidence engaging customers, including senior technical leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Tanium&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Tanium is the Autonomous IT company. Driven by AI and real-time endpoint intelligence, Tanium Autonomous IT empowers IT and security teams to make their organizations unstoppable.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Many of the world’s leading organizations trust Tanium’s single, unified platform for endpoint management and security to innovate faster, stay resilient and move business forward with confidence, at scale. To learn how Tanium delivers Autonomous IT for unstoppable business – visit &lt;a id=&quot;OWA8cd82040-d6a4-2e07-8c22-f773746075e4&quot; href=&quot;http://www.tanium.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;www.tanium.com&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;follow us on &lt;a id=&quot;OWA51246dd5-7f28-280e-6637-139dda4774bb&quot; href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/tanium&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;1&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a id=&quot;OWAd79eefc3-ede9-5e26-14d4-517b82af2392&quot; href=&quot;https://twitter.com/Tanium&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;2&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;On a mission. Together.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At Tanium, we are stewards of a culture that emphasizes the importance of collaboration, respect, and diversity. In our pursuit of revolutionizing the way some of the largest enterprises and governments in the world solve their most difficult IT challenges, we are strengthened by our unique perspectives and by our collective actions.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1440,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a global organization with stakeholders around the world, it’s imperative that the diversity of our customers and communities is reflected internally in our team members. We strive to create a diverse and inclusive environment where everyone feels they have opportunities to succeed and grow because we know that only together can we do great things. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to excellence and innovation has earned us a place on the Forbes Cloud 100 list for ten consecutive years, and we continue to be recognized worldwide as a great place to work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Each of our team members has 5 days set aside as volunteer time off (VTO) to contribute to the communities they live in and give back to the causes they care about most.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The annual base salary range for this full-time position is $169,000 to $259,000. This range is an estimate for what Tanium will pay a new hire. The actual annual base salary offered may be adjusted based on a variety of factors, including but not limited to, location, education, skills, training, and experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to an annual base salary, team members will receive equity awards and a generous benefits package consisting of medical, dental and vision plan, family planning benefits, health savings account, flexible spending account, transportation savings account, 401(k) retirement savings plan with company match, life, accident and disability coverage, business travel accident insurance, employee assistance programs, disability insurance, and other well-being benefits.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Tanium is an Equal Opportunity and Affirmative Action employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national origin, age, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, protected Veteran status, or other legally protected categories. If you require a reasonable accommodation in searching for a job opening, completing an application, interviewing, or completing any pre-employment testing or requirements, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:accommodations@tanium.com&quot;&gt;accommodations@tanium.com&lt;/a&gt;. For more information refer to the “Know Your Rights” poster which is available here -&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/poster&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://www.eeoc.gov/poster&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
